    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Delve into a handcrafted   wizard simulator inspired classical fantasy fiction, greatly expanded with major updates since the original release. Waltz of the Wizard includes hours of content, thrilling gameplay, humorous characters, cutting-edge  features and many curious secrets. Your journey begins in a  magical tower where you combine arcane ingredients into a boiling cauldron with the help of your torturable skull assistant, Skully, and embark on an absurdly mysterious adventure beyond the tower.\u00a0<strong><u>Playable on PC, Steam Deck or VR!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/85a254f404c7d974afe287306fbb7f82.webp?t=1752233668\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/142283f21ce19d34fc3a1eed52ff9f7c.poster.avif?t=1752233668\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/142283f21ce19d34fc3a1eed52ff9f7c.webm?t=1752233668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/142283f21ce19d34fc3a1eed52ff9f7c.mp4?t=1752233668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/85a254f404c7d974afe287306fbb7f82.webp?t=1752233668\" /></div>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>HIGHLIGHT FEATURES </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Unleash dozens of extraordinary magic abilities, each bending the laws of physics in thrilling and powerful ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd0d Discover absurdly detailed secrets in every corner of your tower.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcdc Large campaign with storyline, combat and challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf99\ufe0f Hundreds of voice interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc8d Incredible voice powers that can be used on everything.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udff0 Infinite level generation mode for endless fun in the Fortress dungeon crawling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc65 Team up with a friend in asymmetric co-op (Requires one player with a VR headset).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc80 Chat with, juggle or torture Skully your skull assistant, imagination is the only limit.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/85a254f404c7d974afe287306fbb7f82.webp?t=1752233668\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/5f9998bfe292d33fd52cb39dd193e73c.poster.avif?t=1752233668\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/5f9998bfe292d33fd52cb39dd193e73c.webm?t=1752233668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/5f9998bfe292d33fd52cb39dd193e73c.mp4?t=1752233668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MEET SKULLY, THE MOST HYPER-INTERACTIVE CHARACTER YOU CAN FIND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Skully is a hyper-interactive character with hundreds of voicelines and enormous amount of unique reactions to what you say, gaze, communicative gestures along with awareness of the environment. Interacting with Skully can be a delightfully mischievous experience, where even the most whimsical actions can lead to hilariously dark outcomes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/85a254f404c7d974afe287306fbb7f82.webp?t=1752233668\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/623848b3f8acf629e96ed38ef64a4949.poster.avif?t=1752233668\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/623848b3f8acf629e96ed38ef64a4949.webm?t=1752233668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/623848b3f8acf629e96ed38ef64a4949.mp4?t=1752233668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>AWESOME VARITY OF INTERACTIONS &amp; MAGIC ABILITIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Your magic abilities are dazzlingly diverse; summon storms of fireballs, manipulate time, or transform objects in the world into frogs, to name a few. Discover mystical artifacts and spellbinding objects each reacting uniquely to your interactions. Ancient relics whisper, potions bubble, and mystical melodies resonate from ethereal instruments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/85a254f404c7d974afe287306fbb7f82.webp?t=1752233668\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/20d6e6dcc45b9e697eb460e3e64159ef.poster.avif?t=1752233668\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/20d6e6dcc45b9e697eb460e3e64159ef.webm?t=1752233668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/20d6e6dcc45b9e697eb460e3e64159ef.mp4?t=1752233668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BLAZINGLY FAST VOICE POWERS TO CONTROL ANYTHING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Use voice interactions with blazingly fast responsiveness! We\u2019ve made great strides to take voice interaction to the next level, and after a total redesign of our voice systems, everything behind voice runs locally on device (no network required!). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/85a254f404c7d974afe287306fbb7f82.webp?t=1752233668\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/5c4adaa3260c3013abddb98ee1901a3c.poster.avif?t=1752233668\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/5c4adaa3260c3013abddb98ee1901a3c.webm?t=1752233668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/5c4adaa3260c3013abddb98ee1901a3c.mp4?t=1752233668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EMBARK ON AN ADVENTURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Your adventure unfolds in a richly woven tapestry of dark humor, mystery, and strange situations. Find yourself navigating a world filled with enchanted curiosities and eerie secrets, where funny, mischievous moments blend with the thrill of crawling through the Observer Fortress. As you delve deeper, the presence of the sinister Observers becomes palpable, their malevolent gaze adding a layer of tension to your whimsical journey of chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/85a254f404c7d974afe287306fbb7f82.webp?t=1752233668\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfc6 Winner of Best Updated Game - UploadVR </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfc6 Winner of Best Innovation - NYX Game Awards </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2b50\ufe0f \u201cAldin helped pioneer VR as we know it today\u201d - Road to VR</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Delve into a handcrafted   wizard simulator inspired classical fantasy fiction, greatly expanded with major updates since the original release. Waltz of the Wizard includes hours of content, thrilling gameplay, humorous characters, cutting-edge  features and many curious secrets. Your journey begins in a  magical tower where you combine arcane ingredients into a boiling cauldron with the help of your torturable skull assistant, Skully, and embark on an absurdly mysterious adventure beyond the tower.\u00a0<strong><u>Playable on PC, Steam Deck or VR!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/85a254f404c7d974afe287306fbb7f82.webp?t=1752233668\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/142283f21ce19d34fc3a1eed52ff9f7c.poster.avif?t=1752233668\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/142283f21ce19d34fc3a1eed52ff9f7c.webm?t=1752233668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/142283f21ce19d34fc3a1eed52ff9f7c.mp4?t=1752233668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/85a254f404c7d974afe287306fbb7f82.webp?t=1752233668\" /></div>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>HIGHLIGHT FEATURES </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Unleash dozens of extraordinary magic abilities, each bending the laws of physics in thrilling and powerful ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd0d Discover absurdly detailed secrets in every corner of your tower.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcdc Large campaign with storyline, combat and challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf99\ufe0f Hundreds of voice interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc8d Incredible voice powers that can be used on everything.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udff0 Infinite level generation mode for endless fun in the Fortress dungeon crawling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc65 Team up with a friend in asymmetric co-op (Requires one player with a VR headset).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc80 Chat with, juggle or torture Skully your skull assistant, imagination is the only limit.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/85a254f404c7d974afe287306fbb7f82.webp?t=1752233668\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/5f9998bfe292d33fd52cb39dd193e73c.poster.avif?t=1752233668\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/5f9998bfe292d33fd52cb39dd193e73c.webm?t=1752233668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/5f9998bfe292d33fd52cb39dd193e73c.mp4?t=1752233668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MEET SKULLY, THE MOST HYPER-INTERACTIVE CHARACTER YOU CAN FIND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Skully is a hyper-interactive character with hundreds of voicelines and enormous amount of unique reactions to what you say, gaze, communicative gestures along with awareness of the environment. Interacting with Skully can be a delightfully mischievous experience, where even the